  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.64,
      "end_seconds": 4.93,
      "duration_seconds": 4.29,
      "text": "morning um doctor is this the right room?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.63,
      "end_seconds": 9.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.81,
      "text": "Yes, have a seat. Tell me what's going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 13.07,
      "end_seconds": 16.56,
      "duration_seconds": 3.49,
      "text": "So, doctor, thank you for seeing us."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 18.11,
      "end_seconds": 21.5,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "so, absolutely, come and sit beside them"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 22.16,
      "end_seconds": 28.89,
      "duration_seconds": 6.73,
      "text": "doctor, it's spots on my forehead and chin that's what we're worried about"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 29.8,
      "end_seconds": 35.44,
      "duration_seconds": 5.64,
      "text": "Right, since when exactly? These questions might sound routine, but they matter."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 36.33,
      "end_seconds": 38.55,
      "duration_seconds": 2.22,
      "text": "about... well, two days"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 39.28,
      "end_seconds": 43.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.79,
      "text": "Rate it it for me, mild, moderate or severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 44.01,
      "end_seconds": 62.88,
      "duration_seconds": 18.87,
      "text": "I, I'd say moderate. Oh, and oily skin. With oily skin, pretty severe, if I'm being honest. Oh, you know, and and a few blackheads. That's been about the same, about three months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 63.78,
      "end_seconds": 66.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "How much does it limit you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 66.82,
      "end_seconds": 70.83,
      "duration_seconds": 4.01,
      "text": "uh, pretty severe, if I'm being honest"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 80.03,
      "end_seconds": 82.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "what's on your current medicine list?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 84.08,
      "end_seconds": 90.97,
      "duration_seconds": 6.89,
      "text": "It's hydrocortisone cream when needed for the eczema. Tamsulosin. I take it at night."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 91.54,
      "end_seconds": 93.5,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "and what strength is that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 95.44,
      "end_seconds": 101.48,
      "duration_seconds": 6.04,
      "text": "0.4 milligrams ah I take febuxostat 80 milligrams once a day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 103.04,
      "end_seconds": 112.26,
      "duration_seconds": 9.22,
      "text": "doctor I think the last prescription for the febuxostat was 40 milligrams we changed it at the last visit"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 113.07,
      "end_seconds": 118.16,
      "duration_seconds": 5.09,
      "text": "Okay. Have you got the newest prescription or the box with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 120.17,
      "end_seconds": 124.3,
      "duration_seconds": 4.13,
      "text": "yeah no I left it it at home"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 143.16,
      "end_seconds": 145.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.11,
      "text": "is there someone at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 146.71,
      "end_seconds": 150.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.99,
      "text": "My husband and I live above the shop"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 152.11,
      "end_seconds": 154.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "what do you do during the day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 155.49,
      "end_seconds": 159.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.51,
      "text": "I look after my grandchildren most days"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 160.03,
      "end_seconds": 164.29,
      "duration_seconds": 4.26,
      "text": "tell me about any past illnesses or ongoing conditions"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 164.9,
      "end_seconds": 179.83,
      "duration_seconds": 14.93,
      "text": "yes eczema i've never really been one for hospitals i've I've had an enlarged prostate yes hmm I've had gout for about ten years now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 180.48,
      "end_seconds": 185.3,
      "duration_seconds": 4.82,
      "text": "any inherited conditions that you know of in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 186.11,
      "end_seconds": 188.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "my mother had a stroke"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 191.91,
      "end_seconds": 196.2,
      "duration_seconds": 4.29,
      "text": "has anything ever caused you a reaction? I mean any allergies"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 197.3,
      "end_seconds": 200.62,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "No I'm not allergic to anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 202.23,
      "end_seconds": 207.41,
      "duration_seconds": 5.18,
      "text": "and what about low mood, irregular periods, scarring or painful cysts?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 208.01,
      "end_seconds": 210.62,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "No none that I've noticed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 211.7,
      "end_seconds": 215.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "Anything with your nerves like weakness or numbness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 218.44,
      "end_seconds": 220.11,
      "duration_seconds": 1.67,
      "text": "nothing odd there"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 231.29,
      "end_seconds": 234.35,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "time for your numbers if that's okay"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 246.2,
      "end_seconds": 248.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "bear with me while this finishes.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 260.09,
      "end_seconds": 266.42,
      "duration_seconds": 6.33,
      "text": "okay: pulse 69, temperature 36.8, blood pressure 122 over 77, saturation 97 percent"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 267.81,
      "end_seconds": 270.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "well, is that alright, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 272.01,
      "end_seconds": 274.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2,
      "text": "we'll go over that shortly"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 275.25,
      "end_seconds": 278.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "Okay, time for me to examine you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 279.41,
      "end_seconds": 280.66,
      "duration_seconds": 1.25,
      "text": "does that hurt?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 298.92,
      "end_seconds": 304.13,
      "duration_seconds": 5.21,
      "text": "there are small blackheads and a few red spots with no deep cysts"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 308.98,
      "end_seconds": 323.0,
      "duration_seconds": 14.02,
      "text": "all finished thank you so based on the history and the examination I think we're dealing with mild acne at this stage the reason I say that is that your story and my examination fit together"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 324.53,
      "end_seconds": 327.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.99,
      "text": "Do you think it's something serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 329.45,
      "end_seconds": 345.49,
      "duration_seconds": 16.04,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like mild acne. Just to be sure I understood. You've had spots on your forehead and chin for two days, moderate, and no painful cysts or low mood."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 346.39,
      "end_seconds": 347.09,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Exactly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 350.73,
      "end_seconds": 364.62,
      "duration_seconds": 13.89,
      "text": "let's use benzoyl peroxide gel, 5%, once a day, eight weeks that's for acne and please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 366.23,
      "end_seconds": 368.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.22,
      "text": "thank you, that's clear"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 369.05,
      "end_seconds": 371.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "Have I covered everything you wanted?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 372.85,
      "end_seconds": 377.07,
      "duration_seconds": 4.22,
      "text": "Good uh thanks I'll see you then."
    }
